<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cossack, Griffin platforms prepare to shutdown.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cossack, Griffin platforms prepare to shutdown.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cossack-Pioneer and Griffin offshore oil rigs are preparing to halt production as a tropical low off the coast off Western Australia threatens to build into a cyclone, spokespersons for both rigs said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
